    }
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "hash": "I+CCS2HNXbOKETXblYtZ58uAsE0=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.009Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_DESCRIPTION",
      "input": {
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.000Z",
        "description": "No provider component: init is via useRenownInit. useUser() returns User|undefined. Sessions live in the renown_session cookie, not sessionStorage."
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.009Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "hash": "P93IPHbyIEPqRB/mLFxFO3BVeWU=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.009Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The `@renown/sdk` provides decentralized identity authentication for Powerhouse apps. There is **no provider component**: `RenownUserProvider` returns zero hits in source. Initialization runs through the `useRenownInit` hook (`packages/reactor-browser/src/hooks/renown.ts`), and no `window.renown` / `window.connectCrypto` globals exist. `useUser()` returns `User | undefined` (`renown.ts:29`) -- not an object bundle; the other values come from sibling hooks (`useRenown`, `useLoginStatus`, `useRenownLoginMethods`, `useRenownInitialUser`). Users are identified by DIDs in `did:pkh:eip155:<chainId>:<ethAddress>` format. The `User` type includes `did`, `address`, `name`, `email`, `avatar`, and `ethAddress`. Sessions are **not** in `sessionStorage` -- that identifier has zero hits in the entire monorepo. The session lives in a cookie, `RENOWN_SESSION_COOKIE = \"renown_session\"` (`packages/renown/src/constants.ts:6`), with a localStorage seed used only to cover the first paint before the SDK becomes authoritative. The `RenownAuthButton` is a headless component with render props for customization. LoginStatus flows: `initial` -> `checking` -> `authorized` | `not-authorized`.\n\n_Source-verified 2026-08-13 against Powerhouse source at v6.2.2-dev.45._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:34:44.009Z"
    }
  },
